# Update the global motion parameters. Takes effect for subsequent
# MOVE_LINEAR commands and does not move the machine.
#
# Partial updates: a field set to 0 keeps its current value, so a caller
# can change only the velocity or only the pen heights. Non-zero fields
# replace the corresponding cached value. There is no readback; the
# primitive mirrors the last values it sent to the PLC.
#
# This mirrors CMD_SET_PARAM(0x04) on the wire: vel, acc, dec, jerk,
# z_up, z_down = 6 x f32. The PLC has no per-point profile.
#
# Units: mm, mm/s, mm/s^2, mm/s^3.
# Pen heights must satisfy the primitive's configured
# z_min <= z_down < z_up <= z_max.
float64 velocity
float64 acceleration
float64 deceleration
float64 jerk
float64 z_up
float64 z_down
---
bool   success
string message